      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Which of the following is an element of the set $C=\\{\\{a\\},\\,b,\\,\\{c\\},\\,d,\\,\\{e\\}\\}?$",
      "worked_solution": "The elements of our set are as follows:\n\n$$\n\\{a\\},\\,b,\\,\\{c\\},\\,d,\\,\\{e\\}\n$$\n\nAmong the given options, the only element that belongs to the set is $\\{e\\}.$\n\n**Watch out!** Note that $e$ is *not* an element of our set. Our set contains an element $\\{e\\}$ that is a set itself.",
