      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Which set represents all positive integers less than or equal to $15?$",
      "worked_solution": "To express the desired set, we start with the first positive integer less than or equal to $15,$ which is $1.$ The next positive integer is $2,$ the one after that is $3,$ and so on up to $15$ (which is the last number that is less than or equal to $15$).\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\{1,2,3,…,15\\}.\n$$",
